    "attribution": "00111p:《感受天氣嘅女仔》Weather Girl\n \nThe CC BY 4.0 license REQUIRES that any reused or repurposed content must have the correct ATTRIBUTION. Please use the text below in your citations, printouts and copyright pages.\n \nAttribution Text \n\n\n“Weather Girl” (Cantonese), translated by HamBaangLaang (© HamBaangLaang, 2020) is a derivative of Weather Book (Cantonese) translated by Dohliam, published by Hong Kong Storybook under a CC BY 3.0license, based on the original story Weather Book (English), written by Clare Verbeek, Thembani Dladla, Zanele Buthelezi, illustrated by Sandra McDougall, published by African Storybook Initiative (© African Storybook Initiative, 2007)under a CC BY 4.0 license on www.africanstorybook.org\n \n[Find out more here: HamBaangLaang Attribution terms and CC 4.0]\n________________",
    "timing": "untimed",
